# 🧪 Joon's Sandbox
Welcome! My name is **WonJoon Choi**, and this is my personal sandbox for computational fluid dynamics (CFD) simulations.

My primary interest lies in multiphase flow interface tracking using the Volume of Fluid (VOF) method. The projects here are explorations into various fluid phenomena, numerical methods, and programming exercises, all centered around the Basilisk framework.

Currently, my main focus is on simulating multiphase flows in environments with moving embedded boundaries.

